1
00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:16,440
Mr. He, please take a seat.

2
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:18,040
My boss will be here shortly.

3
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:33,260
Mr. Alex, it's a privilege.

4
00:00:37,350 --> 00:00:38,280
Why is it you?

5
00:00:38,320 --> 00:00:39,340
Where is your boss?

6
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:42,000
Mr. He, this is the proprietor
of Cloudsea Club,

7
00:00:42,010 --> 00:00:42,940
Mr. Alex.

8
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:53,880
Have you come to pick
another fight today, Mr. He?

9
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:58,070
Mr. Alex.

10
00:00:58,240 --> 00:00:59,560
I was short-sighted and acted recklessly.

11
00:00:59,560 --> 00:01:01,090
I drank to excess that night

12
00:01:01,260 --> 00:01:02,260
and offended you.

13
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:04,129
I trust you’re broad-minded enough

14
00:01:04,129 --> 00:01:05,519
to overlook my blunder.

15
00:01:09,220 --> 00:01:12,580
I, He Mu, am ready to do anything you demand.

16
00:01:17,430 --> 00:01:18,760
We are both on our knees.

17
00:01:19,039 --> 00:01:22,039
Such an apology means nothing.

18
00:01:27,039 --> 00:01:28,700
What's the point of kneeling?

19
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:31,010
If we're both down on our knees,

20
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:34,640
this apology carries no weight whatsoever.

21
00:01:38,430 --> 00:01:40,400
Kneeling alone is insufficient.

22
00:01:40,789 --> 00:01:43,870
Kneeling alone is insufficient.

23
00:01:45,840 --> 00:01:47,840
If you do intend to redeem yourself,

24
00:01:48,740 --> 00:01:50,300
you ought to figure out

25
00:01:51,509 --> 00:01:53,870
how to offer genuine restitution.

26
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:00,120
Mr. Alex.

27
00:02:00,510 --> 00:02:01,870
Name whatever you want.

28
00:02:03,050 --> 00:02:05,930
I will accomplish it, no matter what.

29
00:02:13,710 --> 00:02:15,380
[Dearest Episode 8]

30
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:52,079
Mr. Alex. Does this satisfy you?

31
00:02:53,480 --> 00:02:54,160
Mr. He.

32
00:02:55,160 --> 00:02:58,040
Your wife once splashed
staggering sums at Cloudsea.

33
00:02:58,040 --> 00:02:59,579
She prepared 28

34
00:02:59,740 --> 00:03:01,940
birthday gifts for my closest brother.

35
00:03:02,530 --> 00:03:04,130
Every single one priceless.

36
00:03:04,870 --> 00:03:06,870
The occasion was magnificent.

37
00:03:09,190 --> 00:03:12,590
Sadly, fate was cruel to Jie.

38
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:15,120
He died a brutal death soon after.

39
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:17,280
I wonder

40
00:03:20,340 --> 00:03:22,070
who bore such ruthless malice.

41
00:03:28,590 --> 00:03:31,050
The hundred-day memorial
for Jie is coming.

42
00:03:31,470 --> 00:03:33,530
If you sincerely seeks cooperation,

43
00:03:33,900 --> 00:03:36,960
have your wife furnish another
28 memorial offerings.

44
00:03:37,220 --> 00:03:40,620
Treat it as compensation owed to Cloudsea.

45
00:04:05,200 --> 00:04:05,890
Boss.

46
00:04:07,250 --> 00:04:08,450
Before He Mu left,

47
00:04:08,480 --> 00:04:11,070
he stated he would cover all tabs
at Cloudsea tonight

48
00:04:11,070 --> 00:04:12,800
to demonstrate his sincerity.

49
00:04:13,330 --> 00:04:15,450
Add an extra 0 to the final bill.

50
00:04:16,550 --> 00:04:18,310
Forward the full amount to Jie's family.

51
00:04:18,310 --> 00:04:19,380
Understood, Boss.

52
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:33,390
You serve as Vice President of Wen Group.

53
00:04:33,810 --> 00:04:35,630
How dare you burn through
such staggering funds

54
00:04:35,630 --> 00:04:36,800
inside an entertainment venue?

55
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:38,730
Do you know what rumors circulate?

56
00:04:38,830 --> 00:04:40,500
People say the Wen family's son-in-law

57
00:04:40,500 --> 00:04:42,600
indulges in dissipation and
squanders capital recklessly.

58
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:43,270
Dad,

59
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:45,670
Strike me if you must.

60
00:04:45,830 --> 00:04:47,310
But hear me out.

61
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:51,190
My visits to Cloudsea were entirely
for Wen Group's interests.

62
00:04:51,190 --> 00:04:52,620
Still making excuses!

63
00:04:52,650 --> 00:04:55,250
I can secure the Xingji land
development plot.

64
00:05:01,500 --> 00:05:02,430
What did you say?

65
00:05:04,750 --> 00:05:05,390
Dad.

66
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:06,800
I headed to Cloudsea

67
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:08,680
to seize the Xingji project.

68
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:11,710
Officially, development rights rest

69
00:05:11,710 --> 00:05:14,170
with Minister Zhou of
the Resources Bureau.

70
00:05:14,750 --> 00:05:17,120
Yet the true power pulling the strings

71
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:18,870
is Alex, the owner of Cloudsea.

72
00:05:20,270 --> 00:05:21,430
To claim the land,

73
00:05:22,430 --> 00:05:23,680
I must win him over.

74
00:05:25,510 --> 00:05:26,560
Alex.

75
00:05:27,510 --> 00:05:28,560
I've heard of him.

76
00:05:29,870 --> 00:05:33,360
His backers run deeper than
anyone can fathom.

77
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:34,430
Dad.

78
00:05:35,750 --> 00:05:36,870
I give you my word.

79
00:05:37,430 --> 00:05:41,040
I will capture the Xingji land
for Wen Group.

80
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:43,430
When the board convenes,

81
00:05:43,870 --> 00:05:46,159
I will personally invite Alex to attend

82
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:48,920
and reassure all shareholders.

83
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:59,159
Whether you earn the vice
chairman position seat

84
00:05:59,750 --> 00:06:02,550
depends entirely on your
performance this round.

85
00:06:02,870 --> 00:06:04,870
If you bring shame on me

86
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,570
over such a big project,

87
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:09,800
forget the vice chairman position.

88
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:11,270
-Let alone...
-Dad.

89
00:06:11,270 --> 00:06:12,360
I swear on my life.

90
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:16,040
I will secure Xingji for Wen Group.

91
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:32,159
Sell my two vintage cars

92
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,390
to raise sufficient capital.

93
00:06:34,390 --> 00:06:37,040
Match every gift Wen Xin once gave Jie,

94
00:06:38,430 --> 00:06:40,760
and send double the quantity to Cloudsea.

95
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:42,360
Boss.

96
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,510
Last time Alex added an extra 0

97
00:06:44,510 --> 00:06:45,430
to the bill,

98
00:06:45,430 --> 00:06:47,159
it already cost you a fortune.

99
00:06:47,390 --> 00:06:49,909
Now you plan to pour even
more money into gifts.

100
00:06:49,909 --> 00:06:50,300
You

101
00:06:50,690 --> 00:06:52,550
fail to grasp the bigger picture.

102
00:06:53,960 --> 00:06:55,750
No matter the price tag,

103
00:06:56,159 --> 00:06:58,220
I cannot afford to let this plan fail.

104
00:06:59,120 --> 00:06:59,870
Boss.

105
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:00,800
Enough.

106
00:07:04,740 --> 00:07:05,810
Give me a massage.

107
00:07:24,540 --> 00:07:27,150
Boss. These were delivered by He Mu's men.

108
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:29,680
He says he will send double the gifts

109
00:07:29,770 --> 00:07:31,570
his wife previously presented.

110
00:07:36,020 --> 00:07:39,670
This is an invitation for you
to attend Wen Group's dinner.

111
00:07:40,310 --> 00:07:41,430
Mr. Alex.

112
00:07:45,700 --> 00:07:47,380
The show has just begun.

113
00:07:49,340 --> 00:07:50,430
Phase 3:

114
00:07:51,340 --> 00:07:53,470
Force him to watch everything he built

115
00:07:53,810 --> 00:07:56,620
get stripped away
in front of everyone.

116
00:07:56,940 --> 00:07:57,690
And then,

117
00:07:59,450 --> 00:08:00,690
he loses everything.

118
00:08:09,510 --> 00:08:11,800
Distinguished shareholders and colleagues,

119
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:12,950
Wen Group

120
00:08:12,950 --> 00:08:14,680
has endured more than 40 years.

121
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:18,070
Now we stand at a pivotal stage
for transformation and expansion.

122
00:08:18,070 --> 00:08:20,190
At this strategic summit,

123
00:08:20,430 --> 00:08:23,720
I bring a turning point for Wen Group.

124
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:25,070
I have also

125
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:27,750
invited a key guest today,

126
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:31,760
one of the core masterminds behind
this project.

127
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:34,299
Please join me with warm applause

128
00:08:34,309 --> 00:08:37,309
to welcome Mr. Alex from Cloudsea Club!

129
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:42,840
Mr. Alex, the floor is yours.

130
00:08:49,240 --> 00:08:50,030
One moment.

131
00:09:09,310 --> 00:09:12,030
Thank you for that elaborate
introduction, Mr. He.

132
00:09:12,030 --> 00:09:14,840
Allow me to make proper introductions
for everyone.

133
00:09:14,840 --> 00:09:15,960
This is Jiang Yu,

134
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:17,670
proprietor of Cloudsea Club,

135
00:09:17,670 --> 00:09:18,720
Mr. Alex.

136
00:09:27,510 --> 00:09:28,600
also...

137
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:31,840
my fiancé.

138
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:39,770
Jianan, are you joking?

139
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:40,720
How could Dr. Jiang

140
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:42,360
be Mr. Alex?

141
00:09:42,430 --> 00:09:43,960
This gentleman is Mr. Alex.

142
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:46,440
Mr. He, you must have misheard.

143
00:09:46,650 --> 00:09:48,290
I am not Mr. Alex.

144
00:09:48,620 --> 00:09:50,150
I am Mr. Alex's assistant.

145
00:09:50,870 --> 00:09:53,350
He is the real Alex.

146
00:10:03,790 --> 00:10:04,480
I have

147
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:07,700
a major announcement to share today.

148
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:10,840
This is the development
contract for Xingji.

149
00:10:10,950 --> 00:10:13,100
A top-tier team has claimed the bid.

150
00:10:13,430 --> 00:10:15,190
The leader of that team

151
00:10:15,220 --> 00:10:16,820
is my fiancée,

152
00:10:17,040 --> 00:10:18,230
Ms. Wen Jianan.

153
00:10:19,790 --> 00:10:20,550
Thank you.

154
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:29,330
Dad, you no longer need
to worry about this.

155
00:10:29,730 --> 00:10:32,260
I will steer the project
forward personally.

156
00:10:39,640 --> 00:10:40,330
Dad.

157
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:43,870
The Xingji project is out of your hands.

158
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,620
Hand it over to Jianan.

159
00:10:54,350 --> 00:10:56,560
I never imagined you are Mr. Alex.

160
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:58,100
A pleasure to meet you.

161
00:10:59,150 --> 00:11:00,150
Jianan has

162
00:11:00,150 --> 00:11:01,750
rendered extraordinary merit to the group

163
00:11:01,750 --> 00:11:03,510
by securing the Xingji project.

164
00:11:03,510 --> 00:11:06,310
As her grandfather, I must
grant a fitting reward.

165
00:11:06,670 --> 00:11:08,320
The Strategic Director position

166
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:09,510
has long sat vacant.

167
00:11:09,510 --> 00:11:12,510
I've decided to give this
position to Jianan

168
00:11:13,150 --> 00:11:14,550
as your engagement gift.

169
00:11:15,150 --> 00:11:16,280
Thank you, Grandpa.

170
00:11:17,820 --> 00:11:18,540
Everyone,

171
00:11:18,670 --> 00:11:20,670
I am confident with Alex's support,

172
00:11:20,750 --> 00:11:23,510
our project will advance at full speed.

173
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:24,500
Excellent.

174
00:11:28,750 --> 00:11:30,510
Thank you for your faith, Grandpa.

175
00:11:30,510 --> 00:11:32,510
I will deliver results on Xingji

176
00:11:32,870 --> 00:11:35,470
and carve out broader territory
for Wen Group.

177
00:11:35,870 --> 00:11:36,510
Splendid.

178
00:11:36,510 --> 00:11:37,770
Assistant, come over.

179
00:11:37,790 --> 00:11:38,630
Come on.

180
00:11:39,180 --> 00:11:40,580
On such an important day,

181
00:11:40,750 --> 00:11:42,320
let's take a group photo to
preserve this moment.

182
00:11:42,320 --> 00:11:42,960
Come on.

183
00:11:43,670 --> 00:11:45,910
Three, two, one.

184
00:11:48,710 --> 00:11:49,350
Dad.

185
00:11:50,100 --> 00:11:51,150
I've won.
